  "details": "This is the most powerful tool currently used by the community to improve performance. It allows the user to have more avatar features shown as even a high end PC struggles in a populated instance with low safety settings.\n Number of metres at which an avatar would be loaded in would be set by the user, allowing customization based on world scale, layout and population. Placement in the launchpad would be ideal for quick access when entering an instance. An additional setting for PhysBone render distance would also be very useful for those with lower end PCs. This feature would allow users with unplayable framerates to use VR.",
